      "description": "Uses position_near_with_facing because this is a 'find' task — the player must navigate near the cracked stone brick path and face it to observe it. Target is the middle of the path at (3, -1, 4). Max distance 16 blocks with 60° facing tolerance ensures the player is looking at the path.",
